        "turnOrMisdirection": "Instead of finding a cartoon villain, Nadia uncovers a four-year pattern of sub-$200 Tuesday disbursements by a 22-year bookkeeper who started with a $400 nursing-home shortfall\u2014forcing the executive director to choose between a clean PR stage and a 60-second cold open of radical transparency.",
        "payoffOrTag": "Pause for two full seconds after the chairwoman stands to clap, then pivot directly into your keynote thesis: 'Your organization's integrity is never tested by the million-dollar decisions\u2014it is tested by the $185 exceptions you wave through.'",
