      "craftBreakdown": {
        "setupSummary": "Establishes a tactile, high-stakes environment\u2014nineteen minutes before a sold-out community theater premiere\u2014where a hidden knot in donated pine snaps a load-bearing porch riser.",
        "turnOrMisdirection": "The audience expects a technical delay or a noisy, last-minute carpentry rescue, but the director forbids noise and time runs out, forcing Maren to abandon standard tools for a structural splint of scrap steel and duct tape.",
        "payoffOrTag": "Transition directly to your keynote thesis: 'Your audience, your customers, and your team don't care about the perfect blueprint you lost nineteen minutes before launch\u2014they only care whether the floor holds when the lights come up.'",
        "whyItLands": "It grounds abstract leadership concepts like agility and grit in physical, sensory stakes\u2014the smell of rain, the crack of wood, the gleam of silver tape\u2014making the final quiet triumph feel earned."
      },
