        "turnOrMisdirection": "Nadia's initial by-the-book escalation\u2014calls, legal threats, and waving a laminated manifest\u2014fails completely. The turn happens when she leaves her clipboard, iPad, and corporate authority in the car and asks Marcus for his craft rather than his compliance.",
